==Description==
The '''Bees Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 30 of the premium [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{Bunz|1,020}} or {{Robux|135}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bunz|14,510}} or {{Robux|2,820}}.

The '''Bees Nametag''' has yellow uppercase text with a dark orange outline. Yellow hexagons, sparkles and glitter emit from the text. Droplets of honey fall from the text. Dark orange smoke is seen behind the text.

